From 99fbf0c88780c06b07a72ddfe496c8f062047678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:11:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 153/156] wrench: compile_shaders, every shader variant in the
 current context

Compiles and links each shader variant for the context's shader version
and reports every failure, with the sources under --verbose; the sources
come from WRENCH_SHADERS when set, so shader edits need no rebuild.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 gfx/wr/wrench/src/args.yaml          |  2 +
 gfx/wr/wrench/src/compile_shaders.rs | 93 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 gfx/wr/wrench/src/main.rs            |  7 +++
 3 files changed, 102 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 gfx/wr/wrench/src/compile_shaders.rs

diff --git a/gfx/wr/wrench/src/args.yaml b/gfx/wr/wrench/src/args.yaml
index 49ffbd5762c2..c029b630c5d7 100644
--- a/gfx/wr/wrench/src/args.yaml
+++ b/gfx/wr/wrench/src/args.yaml
@@ -189,3 +189,5 @@ subcommands:
         about: Test for successful initialization then exit immediately
     - test_shaders:
         about: run shader tests
+    - compile_shaders:
+        about: compile and link every shader variant in the current GL context
diff --git a/gfx/wr/wrench/src/compile_shaders.rs b/gfx/wr/wrench/src/compile_shaders.rs
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..74bac2b1c293
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gfx/wr/wrench/src/compile_shaders.rs
@@ -0,0 +1,93 @@
